  "content": "<h1>暗黑頭顱</h1><p><strong>模組說明</strong></p><p>在玩家死亡時收集他們的頭顱。</p><p><em>支援伺服器端安裝。只需安裝在伺服器上，客戶端無需安裝即可使用。</em></p><p>由製作<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a>的同團隊開發（完整RPG體驗請下載<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG模組包</a>，享受任務與角色扮演玩法）</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>功能特色</h2><p>(這些功能將進一步增強您的原版遊戲體驗)&nbsp;</p><p>這個簡單的模組會在玩家於單人或多人遊戲中被擊殺時掉落頭顱。你可以拾取這些頭顱來收藏。無論是被生物、環境事件或其他玩家擊殺都會觸發效果。<br>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/669/807/player-heads.png\" width=\"1203\" height=\"599\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即租用伺服器與朋友同樂！點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>或下方橫幅，並使用優惠碼<strong>GAMERPOTION</strong>可享75折！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
